LR-TDDFT HF on H2O, gamma_only, nspin=2, lr_unrestricted=1, lr_nstates=3, lr_solver=lapack.
Uses scf_thr=1e-2 so the preliminary SCF reaches the EXX update and the run
can exercise ground-state force output. The old 1e-7 setting exhausted
scf_nmax before EXX was initialized. This coarse, truncated-window case
checks code behavior rather than physical accuracy; two lowest roots remain
negative. Energy and signed force references follow the completed run.
Direct LU solves the small Z equation; abs_gauge=none skips optical output.
The closed-shell HF case retains Z-CG coverage.
